description:
Join us to celebrate Matariki by loving nature!
Come down and plant into the next phase of our restoration project at Tawa Esplanade. We are transforming this park from weeds to thriving native forest.&nbsp;
Let's restore Tawa Esplanade into something that can be enjoyed by the community and can support wildlife!&nbsp;

Learn about Rongoā Rākau, traditional Māori plant medicine.
Emma will talk about the properties of some native plants and discuss the key philosophies, principles and processes of Rongoā Māori. Come to one or both sessions - Emma will cover a different &nbsp;aspect at each session. Bookings are required. &nbsp;
Emma Haslam has supported Donna Kerridge in her Rongoā Māori practice and has trained with well-known Rongoā Māori experts Rob McGowan and Atarangi Muru.
